@startuml System_Flow_Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ActorBkgColor #FFE6E6
skinparam ParticipantBkgColor #E1F5FE
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #0277BD
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBkgColor #E1F5FE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9E6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #FFA500

title PRM System - System Flow Diagram

actor "Client Application" as Client
participant "PRM.Api\n(Controllers)" as API
participant "PRM.Application\n(Services)" as Service
participant "PRM.Infrastructure\n(Repositories)" as Repo
database "SQLite\nDatabase" as DB
participant "Infrastructure\n(Auth/AI)" as Infra

note over Client
PRM Console Client
end note

== Authentication Flow ==
Client -> API: POST /api/auth/login
API -> Service: AuthService.LoginAsync()
Service -> Repo: IUserRepository.GetByUsernameAsync()
Repo -> DB: SELECT User WHERE Username=?
DB --> Repo: User record
Repo --> Service: User entity
Service -> Service: Verify Password (BCrypt)
Service -> Infra: ITokenService.GenerateToken()
Infra --> Service: JWT Token
Service --> API: LoginResponseDto
API --> Client: Token + User Info

== Resource Management Flow ==
Client -> API: GET /api/projects
API -> Service: ProjectService.GetAllProjectsAsync()
Service -> Repo: IProjectRepository.GetAllAsync()
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM Projects
DB --> Repo: Project records
Repo --> Service: Project entities
Service --> API: ProjectDto collection
API --> Client: JSON response

== Project & Team Allocation Flow ==
Client -> API: POST /api/allocations
API -> Service: AllocationService.CreateAllocationAsync()
Service -> Repo: IEmployeeRepository.GetByIdAsync()
Repo -> DB: SELECT Employee WHERE Id=?
DB --> Repo: Employee record
Repo --> Service: Employee entity
Service -> Repo: IProjectRepository.GetByIdAsync()
Repo -> DB: SELECT Project WHERE Id=?
DB --> Repo: Project record
Repo --> Service: Project entity
Service -> Repo: IAllocationRepository.CreateAsync()
Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO Allocations
DB --> Repo: Confirmation
Repo --> Service: Allocation entity
Service --> API: AllocationResponseDto
API --> Client: Created allocation

== Timesheet Submission Flow ==
Client -> API: POST /api/timesheets
API -> Service: TimesheetService.SubmitTimesheetAsync()
Service -> Service: Validate Hours (≤ MaxWeeklyHours)
Service -> Repo: ITimesheetRepository.CreateAsync()
Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO Timesheets
DB --> Repo: Confirmation
Repo --> Service: Timesheet entity
Service -> Infra: Trigger AI Analysis (optional)
Infra --> Service: Analysis results
Service --> API: TimesheetResponseDto
API --> Client: Timesheet submitted

== Configuration & AI Integration ==
Client -> API: GET /api/config
API -> Service: SystemConfigService.GetConfigAsync()
Service -> Repo: ISystemConfigRepository.GetConfigAsync()
Repo -> DB: SELECT SystemConfig
DB --> Repo: Config record
Repo --> Service: SystemConfig entity
Service --> API: ConfigResponseDto
API --> Client: System config

note over Infra
- JWT Token Service
- Password Hashing (BCrypt)
- AI Provider Integration (Gemini)
- Scheduler Service (Background Jobs)
end note

@enduml
